{"unit_id":"MarvekG__dsh-plugins#feature-1","repo":"MarvekG/dsh-plugins","commit":"fb852ebfcefa8c860826b25a2223a7579f7115bc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@MarvekG/dsh-plugins 的功能「兼容重复沙箱参数」：工具调用携带已被当前有效模式覆盖的合法升级请求时，移除升级模式和说明字段，再把其余参数交给原工具执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["sandbox-same-mode.js:31-56","sandbox-same-mode.js:70-75"]}
